[{"id":"1e7cd37","elType":"section","settings":{"gap":"wider"},"elements":[{"id":"763c929","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"cd46f84","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"22fb800","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<div class="khmer-news-container">
<div class="khmer-title">កម្ពុជាត្រៀមខ្លួនធ្វើជាម្ចាស់ផ្ទះនៃព្រឹត្តិការណ៍ ICIA 2026 Global Round ក្រោមការគាំទ្រយ៉ាងពេញទំហឹងពីក្រសួងអប់រំ យុវជន និងកីឡា</div>
<div class="khmer-body">
<p>ក្រុមការងារអង្គការពិព័រណ៍វិទ្យាសាស្រ្តកម្ពុជា (STEMEOC) មានកិត្តិយសបានចូលជួបសម្ដែងការគួរសម និងពិភាក្សាអំពីកម្មវិធីប្រកួតប្រជែង ICIA 2026 Global Round ជាមួយលោកជំទាវបណ្ឌិត គឹម សេដ្ឋានី រដ្ឋលេខាធិការប្រចាំការក្រសួងអប់រំ យុវជន និងកីឡា អមជាមួយក្រុមការងារ ICIA Global International Team តំណាងសាលាអន្តរជាតិផារ៉ាហ្គន និងក្រុមការងារ AIESEC។</p>
<p>ជាមោទនភាពសម្រាប់កម្ពុជាក្នុងការសហការធ្វើជាម្ចាស់ផ្ទះរៀបចំព្រឹត្តិការណ៍លំដាប់ថ្នាក់អន្តរជាតិនេះឡើង។ ជាពិសេស សម្រាប់ការប្រកួតជុំជម្រុះក្នុងឆ្នាំនេះ យើងទទួលបានបេក្ខជនកើនឡើងដល់ទៅ ៣ដង ដែលជាសមិទ្ធផលប្រវត្តិសាស្ត្រសបញ្ជាក់ពីការរីកចម្រើននៃវិស័យស្ទែម (STEM) នៅកម្ពុជា។<br /><br /></p>
<div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<div dir="auto">        STEMEOC had the honor of meeting with H.E. Kim Sethany, Permanent Secretary of State of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, alongside the ICIA Global International Team, representatives from Paragon International School, and the AIESEC team.</div>
</div>
<div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<div dir="auto">During the meeting, we presented our preparations for the upcoming ICIA 2026 Global Round, with Cambodia proudly serving as a co-host country. We are truly encouraged by the Ministry’s strong support in making this international event a success.</div>
<div dir="auto">We are also proud to share that this year’s National Selection saw a threefold increase in participating teams, setting a new record.</div>
</div>
<div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<div dir="auto">       This remarkable achievement was warmly recognized by Her Excellency, marking an exciting milestone for STEM development in Cambodia. <span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tc6/1/16/1f680.png" alt="🚀" width="16" height="16" /><br /><br /></span></div>
</div>
<div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<div dir="auto"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png" alt="📅" width="16" height="16" /></span> Dates: 24–26 April 2026</div>
<div dir="auto"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png" alt="📍" width="16" height="16" /></span> Location: Phnom Penh, Cambodia</div>
<div dir="auto"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t28/1/16/1f3eb.png" alt="🏫" width="16" height="16" /></span> Venue: Paragon International School</div>
</div>
<div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<div dir="auto">Together, we are committed to advancing STEM education in Cambodia.</div>
</div>
<div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<div dir="auto">We look forward to welcoming you all—mark your calendars!<span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf4/1/16/2728.png" alt="✨" width="16" height="16" /></span><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od"><img class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" src="https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tac/1/16/1f4cc.png" alt="📌" width="16" height="16" /></span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="event-details-box"><strong>អំពីកម្មវិធី៖</strong>
<ul>
<li>📅 <strong>កាលបរិច្ឆេទប្រកួត៖</strong> ថ្ងៃទី២៤ ដល់ ២៦ ខែមេសា ឆ្នាំ២០២៦</li>
<li>📍 <strong>ទីកន្លែង៖</strong> សាលាអន្តរជាតិផារ៉ាហ្គន (រាជធានីភ្នំពេញ)</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; color: #d62828;">ចូលរួមទាំងអស់គ្នា ដើម្បីការអប់រំស្ទែមនៅកម្ពុជា! ✨📌</p>
</div>
</div>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#070707","custom_css":"/* Import Kantumruy Pro from Google Fonts */
